            "10,62",
            "11,52"
          ],
          "answer": "10,52",
          "discussion": "15,20 - 4,68 = 10,52."
        },
        {
          "id": "MTK-B01-M01-014",
          "type": "PG",
          "text": "Paman membeli 4 kantong beras. Setiap kantong beratnya 2 1/2 kg. Berat seluruh beras Paman adalah...",
          "options": [
            "8 kg",
            "10 kg",
            "12 kg",
