          "answer": "72 m²",
          "discussion": "Bagian taman = 1 - 2/5 = 3/5. Luas taman = 3/5 x 120 = 72 m²."
        },
        {
          "id": "MTK-B01-M01-024",
          "type": "PG",
          "text": "Hasil dari 2 2/3 : 1 1/6 adalah...",
          "options": [
            "1 9/14",
            "2 2/7",
